# The Foundation Piles (CIPlay foundation_piles): the mudflat, the engineer's note, the first pile's air and jack, the
# third jack refusing while the stingray lives, the second jack, the pile stingray in two phases, the last two jacks,
# the closing note, back to the mudflat; the treasure.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island The Foundation Piles
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Piles
expect hidden closing
zone mudflat
expect step 1
read Pile engineer's note
expect step 2
zone pile_1
air pile_1
expect step 3
use jack1
expect story jack1 1
expect step 4
zone pile_2
expect step 5
use jack3
expect story jack3 0
use jack2
expect story jack2 1
expect step 6
# (a play's kill skips the phase: on.defeat gives both story items)
kill Stingray
wait 3
expect story rayhurt 1
expect story raydown 1
expect step 8
use jack3
expect story jack3 1
expect step 9
use jack4
expect shown closing
expect step 10
read The city holds
expect step 11
zone rubble_bank
expect step 12
read Engineers' survey
expect step 13
open Excavator's toolbox
wait 3
expect step 14
# DEEP 10-24: the notice, the climb, the dive, the jack pump
expect hidden fp_rewchest
use fp_machine
expect hidden fp_rewchest
read Pile engineer's notice
expect step 15
zone fp_trail
expect step 16
# (the ledge cache wants a keycard)
zone fp_summit
expect step 17
expect stand 8.8 50.93 h=42
open Pile-driver's derrick deck box
wait 3
expect story fp_top 1
expect step 18
zone fp_deep
expect step 19
expect stand 87 26 h=-18
open Pump gallery strongbox
wait 3
expect story fp_deep 1
expect step 20
use fp_machine
expect shown fp_rewchest
expect story fp_fixed 1
open Jack pump reward
wait 3
read Jack pump report
expect step 21
zone mudflat_return
expect done
dig
